   "text": "it sounds like m-a-n-g-e without the e-r."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.57,
   "end": 57.57,
   "text": "But for you, we add e-s when we remove our e-r."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.57,
   "end": 61.57,
   "text": "So rather than just an e to make sure we pronounce the last consonant,"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.57,
   "end": 64.57,
   "text": "we also have an s here. We add e-s."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.57,
   "end": 67.57,
   "text": "But it sounds exactly the same as the other forms,"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.57,
   "end": 71.57,
   "text": "just like the two verb without its two ending."
  },
  {
